<title>USA: Geriatric &amp; Medical okays Genesis merger.</title>
<headline>Geriatric &amp; Medical okays Genesis merger.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geriatric &amp; Medical Cos Inc said on Thursday its shareholders approved its merger into a subsidiary of Genesis Health Ventures Inc.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, Geriatric would be merged into a wholly-owned subsidiary of Genesis and Geriatric shareholders would receive $5.75 per share in cash, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The transaction was adopted and approved at a special shareholder meeting, it said.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
